Purpose:
List-oriented helpers built in Raden itself.

Exports:
- map : iterate a list and call a callback for each item

Examples:
printer defun
  print
  "\n" print
end

(1 2 3) printer map call

printer callback let
(4 5 6) callback map call
*]

map defun
    callback let
    tha-list let
    0 i let
    tha-list len list-length let
    i list-length < loop
        tha-list i index callback call
        i 1 + i set
        i list-length <
    end
end

map foreach let
